WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.390
This pipeline worked. Ten quality gates, Python scripts, raw logs. But only the person who built it could read it.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:16.130
Here is the real run: three hundred and seventy-nine ads in, every number re-checked by a gate.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:28.100
So I turned it into a funnel anyone can follow. Three hundred and seventy-nine advertisers screened, ten point six percent qualified, in about twenty-seven minutes of machine time.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:39.680
And the logs hid the real insight. On the same hundred and sixteen companies: one usable personal email, seventy-eight published phone numbers. The channel was the phone.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:45.880
One result, three formats: a live demo, a one-page narrative, and this video.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.930
From prototype to polished, without losing speed. I'm Matteo Pastena.
